 <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>The problem</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Wholesale shouldn\'t mean a second system.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\">Most merchants end up running wholesale through email threads, a separate price list nobody trusts, and manual invoices typed up after the fact. Shopify\'s native B2B is powerful but bare: it doesn\'t give you dealer approval workflows, tiered discount rules, or a storefront that actually looks wholesale.</p>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\"><strong style=\"color:var(--ink)\">B2B Wholesale Suite fills exactly that gap</strong>: dealer vetting, flexible pricing rules, and net terms checkout, layered directly on top of the Shopify B2B infrastructure you\'re already paying for.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Time to first order</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-71%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,7 30,6 45,11 60,10 75,16 100,20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Approved dealer</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View account</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">DEALER APPROVED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Wholesale</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Pricing unlocked instantly</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Registration</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Approval</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale pricing</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Live in Shopify</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">One approval, <strong>full access</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">See how it works</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">wholesale, built right into Shopify</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n