ow:none;\"></span>The key difference</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Works with Shopify B2B. Not around it.</h2>\n      <p>A lot of wholesale apps fight Shopify\'s own B2B system or ignore it entirely. B2B Wholesale Suite promotes your approved dealers into real Shopify Company and Company Location records, so Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s actual native B2B checkout, not a bolted-on custom one. You get the app\'s dealer management and pricing rules on top of infrastructure Shopify already built and maintains.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">Real Shopify Company records</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Native B2B checkout</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">No parallel platform</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"platform-logos\">\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify<span class=\"plus-tag\">Plus</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Set up your wholesale channel today.</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2026-09-11 15:13:49','2026-09-11 1