  <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>The problem</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Wholesale shouldn\'t mean a second system.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\">Most merchants end up running wholesale through email threads, a separate price list nobody trusts, and manual invoices typed up after the fact. Shopify\'s native B2B is powerful but bare: it doesn\'t give you dealer approval workflows, tiered discount rules, or a storefront that actually looks wholesale.</p>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\"><strong style=\"color:var(--ink)\">B2B Wholesale Suite fills exactly that gap</strong>: dealer vetting, flexible pricing rules, and net terms checkout, layered directly on top of the Shopify B2B infrastructure you\'re already paying for.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Time to first order</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-71%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,7 30,6 45,11 60,10 75,16 100,20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Approved dealer</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View account</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">DEALER APPROVED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Wholesale</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Pricing unlocked instantly</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Registration</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Approval</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale pricing</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Live in Shopify</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">One approval, <strong>full access</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">See how it works</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">wholesale, built right into Shopify</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- NUMBERS / TRUST -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Why merchants add wholesale</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">The numbers behind a wholesale channel.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mt-16\">Illustrative outcomes merchants typically see after launching structured dealer pricing and approval workflows.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"numbers-grid\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--red\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"34\" data-prefix=\"+\" data-suffix=\"%\">+0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average revenue lift after launching a wholesale channel</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--violet\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"3.2\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-suffix=\"&times;\">0&times;</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">More repeat orders from approved dealers vs. one-off buyers</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--blue\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"58\" data-prefix=\"&minus;\" data-suffix=\"%\">&minus;0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Less time spent managing wholesale pricing by hand</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--success\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"48\" data-suffix=\" hrs\">0 hrs</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average turnaround from dealer application to first order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>How it works</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three steps from application to invoice.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <h3>A buyer applies.</h3>\n        <p>Your custom registration form collects exactly what you need (business type, tax ID, expected volume) and lands in your approval queue. Nothing goes live until you say yes.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <h3>You set the rules.</h3>\n        <p>Wholesale pricing, volume discounts, shipping breaks, order minimums: all targeted by dealer, product, or collection, with priority and scheduling built in.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <h3>They order, you get paid your way.</h3>\n        <p>Straight checkout, or Pay Later on net terms through a real Shopify draft order you control end to end.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS GRID -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Everything wholesale needs</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">One app, the whole dealer workflow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-cards\" data-reveal-group>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3\"/><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Dealer Registration &amp; Approval</h3>\n        <p>Custom multi-step forms, manual approval queue, zero public wholesale pricing leakage.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"19\"/><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Pricing Rules</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or override pricing by audience and product scope, with priority and scheduling.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"16\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Volume Pricing</h3>\n        <p>Quantity- or amount-based tiers that stack on top of wholesale rates.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"7\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M16 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Shipping Discounts</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or free shipping tiers by quantity, weight, or subtotal.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Order Limits</h3>\n        <p>Enforce min/max quantity or order value, hard block at checkout if needed.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Extra Fees &amp; Surcharges</h3>\n        <p>Add real cart line items (handling, surcharges) per item or per cart.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Pay Later / Net Terms</h3>\n        <p>Net 30/60/90 checkout via a real Shopify draft order, no automated credit decisions replacing your judgment.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.4 14.5 16 10 4 20\"/><path d=\"m3 3 18 18\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5A5 5 0 1 1 9 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Native B2B Integration</h3>\n        <p>Approved dealers become real Shopify Company/Company Location records, and checkout runs on Shopify\'s own B2B rails.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Custom Invoicing</h3>\n        <p>Native Shopify invoices or fully branded PDF invoices sent via your own SMTP.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Tax Display &amp; Exemption</h3>\n        <p>Tax-inclusive/exclusive pricing, VAT/GST/EIN exemption submissions with live EU VAT registry verification.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Analytics</h3>\n        <p>Revenue, orders, and new applications at a glance.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.59 13.41 11 3.83A2 2 0 0 0 9.59 3.24H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5.59a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.41l9.58 9.59a2 2 0 0 0 2.82 0l4.6-4.6a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.82Z\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Discount Labels &amp; Bulk Select</h3>\n        <p>Clear savings badges, fast multi-variant bulk ordering for dealers buying in volume.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"center mt-32\" data-reveal>\n      <a href=\"features.html\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See every feature in detail →</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- DIFFERENTIATOR -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"banner\" data-reveal-scale>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#fff;box-shadow:none;\"></span>The key difference</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Works with Shopify B2B. Not around it.</h2>\n      <p>A lot of wholesale apps fight Shopify\'s own B2B system or ignore it entirely. B2B Wholesale Suite promotes your approved dealers into real Shopify Company and Company Location records, so Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s actual native B2B checkout, not a bolted-on custom one. You get the app\'s dealer management and pricing rules on top of infrastructure Shopify already built and maintains.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">Real Shopify Company records</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Native B2B checkout</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">No parallel platform</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"platform-logos\">\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify<span class=\"plus-tag\">Plus</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Set up your wholesale channel today.</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 07:15:24','2026-09-14 07:15:24','',5,'http://localhost:8888/?p=46',0,'revision','',0),(47,0,'2026-09-14 08:12:57','2026-09-14 08:12:57','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<header class=\"hero\">\n  <canvas class=\"hero-canvas\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>For Shopify merchants selling B2B</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Your wholesale channel, built right into <span class=\"text-gradient\">Shopify.</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer, show it wherever it matters on your storefront, and offer net terms checkout, all inside the Shopify admin you already use. No second platform, no clunky spreadsheet quoting.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-ctas\" data-hero-in>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install Free on Shopify App Store</a>\n      <a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\">See how it works ↓</a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"trust-line\" data-hero-in>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      Works alongside Shopify\'s native B2B, not a replacement for it.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"hero-platforms\" data-hero-in>\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify_logo.svg\" alt=\"Shopify\" class=\"hero-platform-logo\">\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify-Plus-Logo-Vector.svg-.png\" alt=\"Shopify Plus\" class=\"hero-platform-logo shopify-plus\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- SOCIAL PROOF STRIP (placeholder, marquee) -->\n<div class=\"proof-strip\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"proof-label\">Built for stores running dealer &amp; reseller networks</span>\n    <div class=\"marquee\">\n      <div class=\"marquee-track\">\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n        <span class=\"logo-ph\">Merchant Logo</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>The problem</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Wholesale shouldn\'t mean a second system.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\">Most merchants end up running wholesale through email threads, a separate price list nobody trusts, and manual invoices typed up after the fact. Shopify\'s native B2B is powerful but bare: it doesn\'t give you flexible pricing rules, a storefront that actually looks wholesale, or a way to vet who gets in.</p>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\"><strong style=\"color:var(--ink)\">B2B Wholesale Suite fills exactly that gap.</strong> Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer and show it however fits your storefront. If you also want to vet buyers before they get in, dealer registration and approval is there too, as its own separate step, not a requirement to make pricing work.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Pricing rules live</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">12</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Classic Canvas Tote</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">One product</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rules</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">3 PRICES</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Pricing</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Same product, priced by who\'s buying</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Retail<br>$24.00</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale A<br>$19.20</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale B<br>$16.80</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Auto-applied</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shown as a <strong>price badge</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">See how it works</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">one product, priced for who\'s buying</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- NUMBERS / TRUST -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Why merchants add wholesale</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">The numbers behind a wholesale channel.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mt-16\">Illustrative outcomes merchants typically see after launching structured dealer pricing and approval workflows.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"numbers-grid\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--red\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"34\" data-prefix=\"+\" data-suffix=\"%\">+0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average revenue lift after launching a wholesale channel</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--violet\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"3.2\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-suffix=\"&times;\">0&times;</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">More repeat orders from approved dealers vs. one-off buyers</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--blue\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"58\" data-prefix=\"&minus;\" data-suffix=\"%\">&minus;0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Less time spent managing wholesale pricing by hand</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--success\">\n        <span class=\"sample-tag\">Sample</span>\n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"48\" data-suffix=\" hrs\">0 hrs</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average turnaround from dealer application to first order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>How it works</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three independent pieces, not one rigid flow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <h3>You set the pricing.</h3>\n        <p>Wholesale, volume, or shipping discount rules, targeted by customer type, product, or collection. Show the result as a price badge, a tiered table, or a bulk-order view, whatever fits your storefront.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <h3>You decide who qualifies.</h3>\n        <p>Open pricing to everyone, restrict it to logged-in accounts, or run a full registration and approval queue if you want to vet dealers first. It\'s a separate setting, not a prerequisite for pricing to work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <h3>They check out, you get paid your way.</h3>\n        <p>Straight checkout, or Pay Later on net terms through a real Shopify draft order you control end to end.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS GRID -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Everything wholesale needs</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">One app, the whole dealer workflow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-cards\" data-reveal-group>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3\"/><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Dealer Registration &amp; Approval</h3>\n        <p>An optional vetting step: custom multi-step forms and a manual approval queue for buyers you want to review before they\'re in.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"19\"/><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Pricing Rules</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or override pricing for any customer type, targeted by product or collection, with priority and scheduling.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"16\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Volume Pricing</h3>\n        <p>Quantity- or amount-based tiers that stack on top of wholesale rates.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"7\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M16 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Shipping Discounts</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or free shipping tiers by quantity, weight, or subtotal.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Order Limits</h3>\n        <p>Enforce min/max quantity or order value, hard block at checkout if needed.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Extra Fees &amp; Surcharges</h3>\n        <p>Add real cart line items (handling, surcharges) per item or per cart.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Pay Later / Net Terms</h3>\n        <p>Net 30/60/90 checkout via a real Shopify draft order, no automated credit decisions replacing your judgment.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.4 14.5 16 10 4 20\"/><path d=\"m3 3 18 18\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5A5 5 0 1 1 9 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Native B2B Integration</h3>\n        <p>Approved dealers become real Shopify Company/Company Location records, and checkout runs on Shopify\'s own B2B rails.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Custom Invoicing</h3>\n        <p>Native Shopify invoices or fully branded PDF invoices sent via your own SMTP.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Tax Display &amp; Exemption</h3>\n        <p>Tax-inclusive/exclusive pricing, VAT/GST/EIN exemption submissions with live EU VAT registry verification.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Analytics</h3>\n        <p>Revenue, orders, and new applications at a glance.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.59 13.41 11 3.83A2 2 0 0 0 9.59 3.24H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5.59a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.41l9.58 9.59a2 2 0 0 0 2.82 0l4.6-4.6a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.82Z\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Discount Labels &amp; Bulk Select</h3>\n        <p>Clear savings badges, fast multi-variant bulk ordering for dealers buying in volume.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"center mt-32\" data-reveal>\n      <a href=\"features.html\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See every feature in detail →</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- DIFFERENTIATOR -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"banner\" data-reveal-scale>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#fff;box-shadow:none;\"></span>The key difference</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Works with Shopify B2B. Not around it.</h2>\n      <p>A lot of wholesale apps fight Shopify\'s own B2B system or ignore it entirely. B2B Wholesale Suite promotes your approved dealers into real Shopify Company and Company Location records, so Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s actual native B2B checkout, not a bolted-on custom one. You get the app\'s dealer management and pricing rules on top of infrastructure Shopify already built and maintains.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">Real Shopify Company records</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Native B2B checkout</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">No parallel platform</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"platform-logos\">\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify<span class=\"plus-tag\">Plus</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Set up your wholesale channel today.</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:12:57','2026-09-14 08:12:57','',5,'http://localhost:8888/?p=47',0,'revision','',0),(48,0,'2026-09-14 08:13:24','2026-09-14 08:13:24','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<header class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>Full feature breakdown</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Everything you need to run wholesale on Shopify.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Every wholesale feature, one app, built directly on top of Shopify\'s own B2B infrastructure.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 1 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">DEALER REGISTRATION &amp; APPROVAL</div>\n      <h2>An optional vetting step, for merchants who want one.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Build your own registration form: text fields, dropdowns, file uploads for a resale certificate, whatever you need to qualify a buyer. Submissions land in one approval queue, and you approve or reject by hand. This is a separate feature from your pricing rules, not a requirement for them: use it if you want to vet buyers before they qualify for wholesale pricing, or skip it and target pricing by other means (logged-in status, tags, a hand-picked list) instead.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Drag-and-drop form builder</span><span>Multi-step</span><span>Approval queue</span><span>Manual approve/reject</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Time to approve</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-62%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,7 30,9 45,13 60,15 75,19 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Resale certificate attached</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Review</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">APPROVED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Dealer</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Registration queue</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Business info</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax ID upload</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Reference check</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Dealer unlocked</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Wholesale pricing <strong>on</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View queue</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">vetted before they see a single price</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 2 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">WHOLESALE PRICING RULES</div>\n      <h2>Pricing rules that actually match how you sell.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set a percentage off, a fixed amount off, or an exact override price. Target rules by audience (everyone, logged-in customers, approved dealers, or a hand-picked list) and by product scope: every product, specific products, a whole collection, or anything tagged a certain way. Rules carry a priority so overlapping rules resolve predictably, and can be scheduled to start later or saved as a draft until you\'re ready.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>% / fixed / override pricing</span><span>Audience targeting</span><span>Rule priority</span><span>Scheduling &amp; drafts</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. order value</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+18%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Classic Canvas Tote</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$24.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$19.20</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">20% OFF</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Wholesale</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Audience: logged-in customers</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Percent off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Fixed off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Override price</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Rule active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Their price <strong>$19.20</strong> &darr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Save rule</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the right price, for the right buyer</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 3 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">VOLUME PRICING</div>\n      <h2>Reward the dealers who order more.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set tiers that discount further as quantity or cart amount goes up: 5% off at 10 units, 10% at 50, whatever fits your margins. It stacks on top of your wholesale rate automatically and shows as a real, readable pricing table right on the product page, so dealers see exactly what ordering more saves them before they add to cart.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Quantity or cart-amount tiers</span><span>Stacks on wholesale rate</span><span>On-page pricing table</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. order size</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+48%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,18 30,19 45,10 60,11 75,5 100,1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Case of Widgets</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">$12.00 / unit</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View tiers</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">-15% AT 100+</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Volume</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Quantity or cart amount</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">10+ units<br>&minus;5%</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">50+ units<br>&minus;10%</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">100+ units<br>&minus;15%</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Tier unlocked</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">You saved <strong>$86.00</strong> &uarr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View table</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the more they buy, the more they save</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 4 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">SHIPPING DISCOUNT RULES</div>\n      <h2>Shipping breaks that scale with the order.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Percent off, a fixed discount, or fully free shipping, tiered by cart quantity, total weight, or subtotal. Set once per audience and it applies automatically at checkout, no manual adjustment needed.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>% / fixed / free shipping</span><span>By quantity, weight, or subtotal</span><span>Automatic at checkout</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. shipping cost</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-32%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,6 30,10 45,9 60,15 75,17 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Pallet of Widgets &middot; 48 lb</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$32.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Free</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">FREE AT 50LB+</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Shipping</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">By quantity, weight, or subtotal</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Percent off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Fixed off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Free shipping</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Rule active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shipping <strong>$0.00</strong> &darr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Save rule</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">shipping breaks that scale with the order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 5 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">ORDER LIMITS</div>\n      <h2>Protect your minimums without micromanaging.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set a minimum or maximum order quantity or value per customer segment. Cross it and checkout stops automatically, every time, so you\'re never chasing down an order that was too small to be worth fulfilling, or manually enforcing a cap.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Min / max quantity or value</span><span>Per customer segment</span><span>Hard block at checkout</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Underfilled orders</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-54%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,8 30,7 45,12 60,14 75,18 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Cart subtotal</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$340.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price\">of $500 min</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">MIN $500</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Order limits</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Per customer segment</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Min quantity</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Min value</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Max cap</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Limit enforced</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Checkout <strong>blocked</strong> below min</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Edit limits</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">protect your minimums, automatically</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 6 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">EXTRA FEE &amp; SURCHARGE RULES</div>\n      <h2>Add real charges, not just discounts.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Handling fees, surcharges, anything that needs its own line item on the order: applied per item or once per cart, with its own tiers. Unlike a discount, this adds a genuinely new charged line to the cart, so it shows up clearly on the order and the invoice.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>New cart line item</span><span>Per item or per cart</span><span>Tiered fee rules</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Fee revenue</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+12%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,18 30,19 45,14 60,15 75,8 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Order subtotal</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">$860.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">+ $25.00 fee</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">+ $25.00</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Surcharge</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Per item or per cart</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Per item</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Per cart</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tiered</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Fee active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shows on <strong>invoice</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Add fee</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">real charges, not just discounts</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 7 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">PAY LATER / NET TERMS CHECKOUT</div>\n      <h2>Let your best dealers order now, pay later.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Offer Net 30, Net 60, Net 90, or custom terms per dealer. When they check out, it creates a real Shopify draft order, and nothing is charged automatically. You review it, adjust anything you need to, and invoice on your own terms. You stay the one making the credit call, not an algorithm.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Net 30 / 60 / 90 / custom</span><span>Real Shopify draft order</span><span>Merchant reviews before invoicing</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Repeat order rate</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+41%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,19 30,16 45,14 60,9 75,8 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Wholesale Order #4821</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$1,240.00 due</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Review terms</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">NET 30</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Pay later</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Net 30 / 60 / 90</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 30</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 60</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 90</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Draft created</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Due in <strong>30 days</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Create draft order</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">order now, invoice on your terms</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 8 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">NATIVE SHOPIFY B2B INTEGRATION</div>\n      <h2>Built on Shopify\'s own B2B infrastructure.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">When you approve a dealer for Pay Later, they\'re promoted into a real Shopify Company and Company Location, not a workaround record the app invents. Their checkout runs through Shopify\'s native B2B checkout flow, meaning it inherits everything Shopify itself maintains there: reliability, updates, and compatibility with other B2B-aware apps.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Real Company / Company Location</span><span>Native B2B checkout</span><span>Compatible with other B2B apps</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Sync reliability</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">100%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,10 15,9 30,10 45,8 60,9 75,7 100,7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Company &amp; Company Location</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View record</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">SYNCED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Native B2B</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Runs on Shopify\'s own rails</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Company record</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Company location</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">B2B checkout</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Live on Shopify</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">No workaround <strong>records</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View company</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">built on Shopify\'s own B2B rails</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 9 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">STOREFRONT THEME BLOCKS</div>\n      <h2>A wholesale storefront that actually looks wholesale.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Drop these into your theme editor, no code required: a wholesale price badge that shows the discount right on the product, a stock-level indicator so dealers know what\'s actually available, a Buy-in-Bulk button that opens a fast multi-variant quantity picker, and your registration form for new applicants. Every block is styled from your app settings, so it matches your theme.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Price badge</span><span>Stock-level indicator</span><span>Buy-in-Bulk button</span><span>Registration form block</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Setup time</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">&lt;5 min</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,6 30,5 45,9 60,8 75,12 100,11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Wholesale Price Badge</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Theme editor block</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Preview</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">NO CODE</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Theme blocks</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Drop into any section</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Price badge</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Stock indicator</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Bulk picker</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Block added</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Matches <strong>your theme</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Add block</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">looks wholesale, right out of the box</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 10 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">CUSTOM INVOICING</div>\n      <h2>Invoices that look like they came from you.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Use Shopify\'s native invoice, or fully customize a branded PDF (your logo, your layout) sent automatically through your own SMTP account when an order\'s ready to be invoiced.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Native Shopify invoice</span><span>Custom branded PDF</span><span>Sent via your own SMTP</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">On-time payment</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+22%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Invoice #1042</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$1,240.00</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Preview PDF</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">PDF READY</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Invoicing</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Branded PDF or native</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Native invoice</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Branded PDF</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Custom SMTP</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Sent</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Delivered via <strong>your SMTP</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Send invoice</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">invoices that look like they came from you</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 11 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">TAX DISPLAY &amp; TAX EXEMPTION</div>\n      <h2>Tax handled the way B2B buyers expect it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Show prices tax-inclusive or tax-exclusive depending on your audience. Let qualifying customers submit a VAT, GST, or EIN number to apply for tax exemption directly at checkout. EU VAT numbers are checked live against the EU\'s own VIES registry, not just format-validated, so exemptions are backed by an actual verification, not just a well-formed number.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Inclusive / exclusive display</span><span>VAT / GST / EIN exemption</span><span>Live EU VIES verification</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Exemptions verified</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">100%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,10 15,9 30,11 45,8 60,9 75,7 100,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">EU VAT Registry (VIES)</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Verified live</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View submission</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">VAT EXEMPT</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Tax</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">VAT / GST / EIN</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax inclusive</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax exclusive</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Exemption cert</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Verified live</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Checked against <strong>VIES</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Review submission</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the right tax, verified automatically</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 12 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">ANALYTICS DASHBOARD</div>\n      <h2>Know your wholesale channel\'s numbers, not just guess them.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">See wholesale revenue, wholesale order count, and new dealer applications over the last 30 days, right on your dashboard, so wholesale stops being the part of the business you can\'t actually measure.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Wholesale revenue</span><span>Order count</span><span>New applications</span><span>30-day view</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">New applications</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+19</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,16 30,17 45,11 60,12 75,5 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Last 30 days</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$48,200 revenue</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View dashboard</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">LIVE</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Analytics</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Revenue, orders, applications</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Revenue</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Orders</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Applications</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Up to date</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Refreshed in <strong>real time</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View dashboard</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">your wholesale channel, at a glance</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 13 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">DISCOUNT LABELS &amp; BULK SELECT</div>\n      <h2>Make the savings and the buying both effortless.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Custom \"you save X%\" badges make the discount obvious on every product. Bulk Select gives dealers a fast way to pick quantities across every variant of a product at once and add them all to cart together, built for orders that are 20 units across 6 sizes, not one at a time.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Custom savings badges</span><span>Multi-variant bulk select</span><span>Fast cart building</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Bulk order speed</span><span class=\"fi-stat-tag\">Sample</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+37%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,19 45,13 60,14 75,7 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Case of Widgets &times; 24</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$288.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$244.80</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Bulk select</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">SAVE 15%</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Bulk select</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Multi-variant fast picker</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Savings badge</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Bulk grid</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Quick add</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Added to cart</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\"><strong>24 units</strong> in one click</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Bulk order</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">built for dealers who buy by the case</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"final-cta section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Ready to see it running on your store?</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Features','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:13:24','2026-09-14 08:13:24','',6,'http://localhost:8888/?p=48',0,'revision','',0),(49,0,'2026-09-14 08:13:44','2026-09-14 08:13:44','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<header class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>FAQ</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Questions merchants ask before installing.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Everything you\'d want to know about how B2B Wholesale Suite fits into your store.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"faq-list\">\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item open\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Does this replace Shopify\'s native B2B, or work with it?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>It works with it. Approved dealers get promoted into real Shopify Company/Company Location records, and Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s own native B2B checkout, so you\'re not adopting a separate system.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Can dealers check out on net terms?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>Yes. Pay Later creates a real Shopify draft order on approval, which you review and invoice on your own schedule. Nothing is charged automatically.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Do I need Shopify Plus?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>No, the app works on any Shopify plan. <em>(Note: Shopify\'s own native B2B checkout-to-draft flow may have plan-level requirements on Shopify\'s side; confirm current Shopify plan requirements before publishing this claim.)</em></p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Can I control who sees wholesale pricing?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>Yes. Each pricing rule sets its own audience: everyone, logged-in customers, or a specific list. If you want an extra layer of control, dealer registration and approval is a separate feature you can turn on to vet buyers before they qualify for any rule, but it\'s optional, not a requirement for wholesale pricing to work.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Can I run different pricing for different customer types?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>Yes. Pricing, volume, shipping, order limit, and fee rules can all be targeted by customer type, down to specific customers or tags, whether or not you\'re using the dealer approval workflow at all.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">What happens if a dealer\'s order doesn\'t meet my minimum?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>If you\'ve set an Order Limit rule, checkout is blocked automatically until the order meets your minimum (or stays under your maximum).</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">Do I need to add code to my theme?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>No, every storefront element (price badge, stock indicator, bulk buy button, registration form) is a drag-and-drop theme block.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-q\">How does tax exemption verification work?\n          <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-a\"><div class=\"faq-a-inner\"><p>Customers submit a tax ID at checkout. EU VAT numbers are checked live against the EU\'s VIES registry; other ID types (UK VAT, AU ABN, India GSTIN, US EIN) are validated by format and checksum, since no free public registry exists for those.</p></div></div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"faq-note\">Don\'t see your question? <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:var(--red-2);font-weight:600;\">Reach out to support</a> before you install.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"final-cta section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Ready to give it a try?</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','FAQ','','inherit','closed','closed','','8-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:13:44','2026-09-14 08:13:44','',8,'http://localhost:8888/?p=49',0,'revision','',0),(50,0,'2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<header class=\"hero\">\n  <canvas class=\"hero-canvas\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>For Shopify merchants selling B2B</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Your wholesale channel, built right into <span class=\"text-gradient\">Shopify.</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer, show it wherever it matters on your storefront, and offer net terms checkout, all inside the Shopify admin you already use. No second platform, no clunky spreadsheet quoting.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-ctas\" data-hero-in>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install Free on Shopify App Store</a>\n      <a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\">See how it works ↓</a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"trust-line\" data-hero-in>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      Works alongside Shopify\'s native B2B, not a replacement for it.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"hero-platforms\" data-hero-in>\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify_logo.svg\" alt=\"Shopify\" class=\"hero-platform-logo\">\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify-Plus-Logo-Vector.svg-.png\" alt=\"Shopify Plus\" class=\"hero-platform-logo shopify-plus\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n\n<!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>The problem</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Wholesale shouldn\'t mean a second system.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\">Most merchants end up running wholesale through email threads, a separate price list nobody trusts, and manual invoices typed up after the fact. Shopify\'s native B2B is powerful but bare: it doesn\'t give you flexible pricing rules, a storefront that actually looks wholesale, or a way to vet who gets in.</p>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\"><strong style=\"color:var(--ink)\">B2B Wholesale Suite fills exactly that gap.</strong> Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer and show it however fits your storefront. If you also want to vet buyers before they get in, dealer registration and approval is there too, as its own separate step, not a requirement to make pricing work.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Pricing rules live</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">12</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Classic Canvas Tote</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">One product</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rules</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">3 PRICES</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Pricing</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Same product, priced by who\'s buying</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Retail<br>$24.00</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale A<br>$19.20</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale B<br>$16.80</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Auto-applied</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shown as a <strong>price badge</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">See how it works</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">one product, priced for who\'s buying</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- NUMBERS / TRUST -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Why merchants add wholesale</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">The numbers behind a wholesale channel.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mt-16\">Illustrative outcomes merchants typically see after launching structured dealer pricing and approval workflows.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"numbers-grid\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--red\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"34\" data-prefix=\"+\" data-suffix=\"%\">+0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average revenue lift after launching a wholesale channel</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--violet\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"3.2\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-suffix=\"&times;\">0&times;</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">More repeat orders from approved dealers vs. one-off buyers</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--blue\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"58\" data-prefix=\"&minus;\" data-suffix=\"%\">&minus;0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Less time spent managing wholesale pricing by hand</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--success\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"48\" data-suffix=\" hrs\">0 hrs</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average turnaround from dealer application to first order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>How it works</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three independent pieces, not one rigid flow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <h3>You set the pricing.</h3>\n        <p>Wholesale, volume, or shipping discount rules, targeted by customer type, product, or collection. Show the result as a price badge, a tiered table, or a bulk-order view, whatever fits your storefront.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <h3>You decide who qualifies.</h3>\n        <p>Open pricing to everyone, restrict it to logged-in accounts, or run a full registration and approval queue if you want to vet dealers first. It\'s a separate setting, not a prerequisite for pricing to work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <h3>They check out, you get paid your way.</h3>\n        <p>Straight checkout, or Pay Later on net terms through a real Shopify draft order you control end to end.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS GRID -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Everything wholesale needs</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">One app, the whole dealer workflow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-cards\" data-reveal-group>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3\"/><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Dealer Registration &amp; Approval</h3>\n        <p>An optional vetting step: custom multi-step forms and a manual approval queue for buyers you want to review before they\'re in.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"19\"/><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Pricing Rules</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or override pricing for any customer type, targeted by product or collection, with priority and scheduling.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"16\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Volume Pricing</h3>\n        <p>Quantity- or amount-based tiers that stack on top of wholesale rates.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"7\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M16 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Shipping Discounts</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or free shipping tiers by quantity, weight, or subtotal.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Order Limits</h3>\n        <p>Enforce min/max quantity or order value, hard block at checkout if needed.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Extra Fees &amp; Surcharges</h3>\n        <p>Add real cart line items (handling, surcharges) per item or per cart.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Pay Later / Net Terms</h3>\n        <p>Net 30/60/90 checkout via a real Shopify draft order, no automated credit decisions replacing your judgment.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.4 14.5 16 10 4 20\"/><path d=\"m3 3 18 18\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5A5 5 0 1 1 9 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Native B2B Integration</h3>\n        <p>Approved dealers become real Shopify Company/Company Location records, and checkout runs on Shopify\'s own B2B rails.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Custom Invoicing</h3>\n        <p>Native Shopify invoices or fully branded PDF invoices sent via your own SMTP.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Tax Display &amp; Exemption</h3>\n        <p>Tax-inclusive/exclusive pricing, VAT/GST/EIN exemption submissions with live EU VAT registry verification.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Analytics</h3>\n        <p>Revenue, orders, and new applications at a glance.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.59 13.41 11 3.83A2 2 0 0 0 9.59 3.24H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5.59a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.41l9.58 9.59a2 2 0 0 0 2.82 0l4.6-4.6a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.82Z\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Discount Labels &amp; Bulk Select</h3>\n        <p>Clear savings badges, fast multi-variant bulk ordering for dealers buying in volume.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"center mt-32\" data-reveal>\n      <a href=\"features.html\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See every feature in detail →</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- DIFFERENTIATOR -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"banner\" data-reveal-scale>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#fff;box-shadow:none;\"></span>The key difference</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Works with Shopify B2B. Not around it.</h2>\n      <p>A lot of wholesale apps fight Shopify\'s own B2B system or ignore it entirely. B2B Wholesale Suite promotes your approved dealers into real Shopify Company and Company Location records, so Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s actual native B2B checkout, not a bolted-on custom one. You get the app\'s dealer management and pricing rules on top of infrastructure Shopify already built and maintains.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">Real Shopify Company records</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Native B2B checkout</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">No parallel platform</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"platform-logos\">\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify<span class=\"plus-tag\">Plus</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Set up your wholesale channel today.</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','',5,'http://localhost:8888/?p=50',0,'revision','',0),(51,0,'2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<header class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>Full feature breakdown</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Everything you need to run wholesale on Shopify.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Every wholesale feature, one app, built directly on top of Shopify\'s own B2B infrastructure.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<!-- 1 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">DEALER REGISTRATION &amp; APPROVAL</div>\n      <h2>An optional vetting step, for merchants who want one.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Build your own registration form: text fields, dropdowns, file uploads for a resale certificate, whatever you need to qualify a buyer. Submissions land in one approval queue, and you approve or reject by hand. This is a separate feature from your pricing rules, not a requirement for them: use it if you want to vet buyers before they qualify for wholesale pricing, or skip it and target pricing by other means (logged-in status, tags, a hand-picked list) instead.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Drag-and-drop form builder</span><span>Multi-step</span><span>Approval queue</span><span>Manual approve/reject</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Time to approve</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-62%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,7 30,9 45,13 60,15 75,19 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Resale certificate attached</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Review</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">APPROVED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Dealer</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Registration queue</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Business info</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax ID upload</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Reference check</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Dealer unlocked</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Wholesale pricing <strong>on</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View queue</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">vetted before they see a single price</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 2 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">WHOLESALE PRICING RULES</div>\n      <h2>Pricing rules that actually match how you sell.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set a percentage off, a fixed amount off, or an exact override price. Target rules by audience (everyone, logged-in customers, approved dealers, or a hand-picked list) and by product scope: every product, specific products, a whole collection, or anything tagged a certain way. Rules carry a priority so overlapping rules resolve predictably, and can be scheduled to start later or saved as a draft until you\'re ready.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>% / fixed / override pricing</span><span>Audience targeting</span><span>Rule priority</span><span>Scheduling &amp; drafts</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. order value</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+18%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Classic Canvas Tote</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$24.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$19.20</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">20% OFF</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Wholesale</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Audience: logged-in customers</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Percent off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Fixed off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Override price</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Rule active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Their price <strong>$19.20</strong> &darr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Save rule</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the right price, for the right buyer</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 3 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">VOLUME PRICING</div>\n      <h2>Reward the dealers who order more.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set tiers that discount further as quantity or cart amount goes up: 5% off at 10 units, 10% at 50, whatever fits your margins. It stacks on top of your wholesale rate automatically and shows as a real, readable pricing table right on the product page, so dealers see exactly what ordering more saves them before they add to cart.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Quantity or cart-amount tiers</span><span>Stacks on wholesale rate</span><span>On-page pricing table</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. order size</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+48%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,18 30,19 45,10 60,11 75,5 100,1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Case of Widgets</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">$12.00 / unit</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View tiers</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">-15% AT 100+</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Volume</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Quantity or cart amount</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">10+ units<br>&minus;5%</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">50+ units<br>&minus;10%</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">100+ units<br>&minus;15%</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Tier unlocked</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">You saved <strong>$86.00</strong> &uarr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View table</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the more they buy, the more they save</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 4 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">SHIPPING DISCOUNT RULES</div>\n      <h2>Shipping breaks that scale with the order.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Percent off, a fixed discount, or fully free shipping, tiered by cart quantity, total weight, or subtotal. Set once per audience and it applies automatically at checkout, no manual adjustment needed.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>% / fixed / free shipping</span><span>By quantity, weight, or subtotal</span><span>Automatic at checkout</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Avg. shipping cost</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-32%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,6 30,10 45,9 60,15 75,17 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Pallet of Widgets &middot; 48 lb</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$32.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Free</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">FREE AT 50LB+</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Shipping</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">By quantity, weight, or subtotal</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Percent off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Fixed off</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Free shipping</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Rule active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shipping <strong>$0.00</strong> &darr;</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Save rule</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">shipping breaks that scale with the order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 5 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">ORDER LIMITS</div>\n      <h2>Protect your minimums without micromanaging.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Set a minimum or maximum order quantity or value per customer segment. Cross it and checkout stops automatically, every time, so you\'re never chasing down an order that was too small to be worth fulfilling, or manually enforcing a cap.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Min / max quantity or value</span><span>Per customer segment</span><span>Hard block at checkout</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Underfilled orders</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">-54%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,8 30,7 45,12 60,14 75,18 100,21\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Cart subtotal</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$340.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price\">of $500 min</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">MIN $500</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Order limits</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Per customer segment</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Min quantity</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Min value</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Max cap</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Limit enforced</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Checkout <strong>blocked</strong> below min</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Edit limits</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">protect your minimums, automatically</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 6 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">EXTRA FEE &amp; SURCHARGE RULES</div>\n      <h2>Add real charges, not just discounts.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Handling fees, surcharges, anything that needs its own line item on the order: applied per item or once per cart, with its own tiers. Unlike a discount, this adds a genuinely new charged line to the cart, so it shows up clearly on the order and the invoice.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>New cart line item</span><span>Per item or per cart</span><span>Tiered fee rules</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Fee revenue</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+12%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,18 30,19 45,14 60,15 75,8 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Order subtotal</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">$860.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">+ $25.00 fee</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rule</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">+ $25.00</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Surcharge</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Per item or per cart</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Per item</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Per cart</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tiered</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Fee active</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shows on <strong>invoice</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Add fee</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">real charges, not just discounts</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 7 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">PAY LATER / NET TERMS CHECKOUT</div>\n      <h2>Let your best dealers order now, pay later.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Offer Net 30, Net 60, Net 90, or custom terms per dealer. When they check out, it creates a real Shopify draft order, and nothing is charged automatically. You review it, adjust anything you need to, and invoice on your own terms. You stay the one making the credit call, not an algorithm.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Net 30 / 60 / 90 / custom</span><span>Real Shopify draft order</span><span>Merchant reviews before invoicing</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Repeat order rate</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+41%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,19 30,16 45,14 60,9 75,8 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Wholesale Order #4821</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$1,240.00 due</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Review terms</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">NET 30</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Pay later</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Net 30 / 60 / 90</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 30</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 60</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Net 90</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Draft created</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Due in <strong>30 days</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Create draft order</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">order now, invoice on your terms</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 8 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">NATIVE SHOPIFY B2B INTEGRATION</div>\n      <h2>Built on Shopify\'s own B2B infrastructure.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">When you approve a dealer for Pay Later, they\'re promoted into a real Shopify Company and Company Location, not a workaround record the app invents. Their checkout runs through Shopify\'s native B2B checkout flow, meaning it inherits everything Shopify itself maintains there: reliability, updates, and compatibility with other B2B-aware apps.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Real Company / Company Location</span><span>Native B2B checkout</span><span>Compatible with other B2B apps</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Sync reliability</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">100%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,10 15,9 30,10 45,8 60,9 75,7 100,7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Acme Hardware Co.</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Company &amp; Company Location</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View record</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">SYNCED</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Native B2B</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Runs on Shopify\'s own rails</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Company record</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Company location</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">B2B checkout</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Live on Shopify</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">No workaround <strong>records</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View company</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">built on Shopify\'s own B2B rails</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 9 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">STOREFRONT THEME BLOCKS</div>\n      <h2>A wholesale storefront that actually looks wholesale.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Drop these into your theme editor, no code required: a wholesale price badge that shows the discount right on the product, a stock-level indicator so dealers know what\'s actually available, a Buy-in-Bulk button that opens a fast multi-variant quantity picker, and your registration form for new applicants. Every block is styled from your app settings, so it matches your theme.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Price badge</span><span>Stock-level indicator</span><span>Buy-in-Bulk button</span><span>Registration form block</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Setup time</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">&lt;5 min</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,4 15,6 30,5 45,9 60,8 75,12 100,11\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Wholesale Price Badge</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">Theme editor block</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Preview</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">NO CODE</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Theme blocks</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Drop into any section</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Price badge</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Stock indicator</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Bulk picker</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Block added</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Matches <strong>your theme</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Add block</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">looks wholesale, right out of the box</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 10 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">CUSTOM INVOICING</div>\n      <h2>Invoices that look like they came from you.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Use Shopify\'s native invoice, or fully customize a branded PDF (your logo, your layout) sent automatically through your own SMTP account when an order\'s ready to be invoiced.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Native Shopify invoice</span><span>Custom branded PDF</span><span>Sent via your own SMTP</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">On-time payment</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+22%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Invoice #1042</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$1,240.00</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Preview PDF</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">PDF READY</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Invoicing</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Branded PDF or native</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Native invoice</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Branded PDF</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Custom SMTP</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Sent</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Delivered via <strong>your SMTP</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Send invoice</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">invoices that look like they came from you</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 11 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">TAX DISPLAY &amp; TAX EXEMPTION</div>\n      <h2>Tax handled the way B2B buyers expect it.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Show prices tax-inclusive or tax-exclusive depending on your audience. Let qualifying customers submit a VAT, GST, or EIN number to apply for tax exemption directly at checkout. EU VAT numbers are checked live against the EU\'s own VIES registry, not just format-validated, so exemptions are backed by an actual verification, not just a well-formed number.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Inclusive / exclusive display</span><span>VAT / GST / EIN exemption</span><span>Live EU VIES verification</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Exemptions verified</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">100%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,10 15,9 30,11 45,8 60,9 75,7 100,6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">EU VAT Registry (VIES)</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">Verified live</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View submission</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">VAT EXEMPT</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Tax</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">VAT / GST / EIN</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax inclusive</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Tax exclusive</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Exemption cert</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Verified live</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Checked against <strong>VIES</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Review submission</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">the right tax, verified automatically</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 12 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split reverse\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">ANALYTICS DASHBOARD</div>\n      <h2>Know your wholesale channel\'s numbers, not just guess them.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">See wholesale revenue, wholesale order count, and new dealer applications over the last 30 days, right on your dashboard, so wholesale stops being the part of the business you can\'t actually measure.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Wholesale revenue</span><span>Order count</span><span>New applications</span><span>30-day view</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">New applications</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+19</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,16 30,17 45,11 60,12 75,5 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Last 30 days</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$48,200 revenue</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View dashboard</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">LIVE</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Analytics</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Revenue, orders, applications</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Revenue</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Orders</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Applications</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Up to date</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Refreshed in <strong>real time</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">View dashboard</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">your wholesale channel, at a glance</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 13 -->\n<section class=\"feature-block\">\n  <div class=\"wrap split\" data-reveal-group>\n    <div class=\"col-text\">\n      <div class=\"index\">DISCOUNT LABELS &amp; BULK SELECT</div>\n      <h2>Make the savings and the buying both effortless.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text\">Custom \"you save X%\" badges make the discount obvious on every product. Bulk Select gives dealers a fast way to pick quantities across every variant of a product at once and add them all to cart together, built for orders that are 20 units across 6 sizes, not one at a time.</p>\n      <div class=\"tags\"><span>Custom savings badges</span><span>Multi-variant bulk select</span><span>Fast cart building</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\">\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Bulk order speed</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">+37%</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,19 45,13 60,14 75,7 100,3\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Case of Widgets &times; 24</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price strike\">$288.00</span><span class=\"fi-product-price now\">$244.80</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">Bulk select</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">SAVE 15%</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Bulk select</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Multi-variant fast picker</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Savings badge</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Bulk grid</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Quick add</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Added to cart</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\"><strong>24 units</strong> in one click</span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">Bulk order</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">built for dealers who buy by the case</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"final-cta section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Ready to see it running on your store?</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Features','','inherit','closed','closed','','6-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','',6,'http://localhost:8888/?p=51',0,'revision','',0),(52,0,'2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<header class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>Contact</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Let\'s talk wholesale.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Questions about a feature, a migration you\'re planning, or a bug you\'ve hit? We read every email ourselves.</p>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"banner\" data-reveal-scale>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#fff;box-shadow:none;\"></span>Get in touch</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">We\'d genuinely like to hear from you.</h2>\n      <p>Email us directly and a real person on the team will reply, usually within one business day.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <a href=\"mailto:contact@b2bsuite.com\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" style=\"background:#fff;color:var(--red-dark);box-shadow:none;\">Email contact@b2bsuite.com</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Who to email</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Pick the right inbox, skip the back-and-forth.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-cards\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6Z\"/><path d=\"m22 6-10 7L2 6\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Sales &amp; general questions</h3>\n        <p>Not sure if this fits your store, or want a walkthrough before you install.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Support &amp; migration</h3>\n        <p>Already a merchant, hit a bug, or planning a move from another wholesale app.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.4 14.5 16 10 4 20\"/><path d=\"m3 3 18 18\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5A5 5 0 1 1 9 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Partnerships &amp; press</h3>\n        <p>Agencies, integration partners, and press inquiries.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Prefer to just try it first?</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. No credit card, no forms to fill out.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Contact','','inherit','closed','closed','','9-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:21:06','2026-09-14 08:21:06','',9,'http://localhost:8888/?p=52',0,'revision','',0),(53,0,'2026-09-14 08:23:39','2026-09-14 08:23:39','<!-- wp:html -->\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<header class=\"hero\">\n  <canvas class=\"hero-canvas\"></canvas>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span class=\"eyebrow\" data-hero-in><span class=\"dot\"></span>For Shopify merchants selling B2B</span>\n    <h1 data-hero-in>Your wholesale channel, built right into <span class=\"text-gradient\">Shopify.</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\" data-hero-in>Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer, show it wherever it matters on your storefront, and offer net terms checkout, all inside the Shopify admin you already use. No second platform, no clunky spreadsheet quoting.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-ctas\" data-hero-in>\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install Free on Shopify App Store</a>\n      <a href=\"#how-it-works\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\">See how it works ↓</a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"trust-line\" data-hero-in>\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"/></svg>\n      Works alongside Shopify\'s native B2B, not a replacement for it.\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"hero-platforms\" data-hero-in>\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify_logo.svg\" alt=\"Shopify\" class=\"hero-platform-logo\">\n      <img src=\"/wp-content/themes/b2b-wholesale-suite/assets/images/Shopify-Plus-Logo-Vector.svg-.png\" alt=\"Shopify Plus\" class=\"hero-platform-logo shopify-plus\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n\n<!-- PROBLEM / SOLUTION -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap split\">\n    <div class=\"col-text\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>The problem</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Wholesale shouldn\'t mean a second system.</h2>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\">Most merchants end up running wholesale through email threads, a separate price list nobody trusts, and manual invoices typed up after the fact. Shopify\'s native B2B is powerful but bare: it doesn\'t give you flexible pricing rules, a storefront that actually looks wholesale, or a way to vet who gets in.</p>\n      <p class=\"body-text mt-16\"><strong style=\"color:var(--ink)\">B2B Wholesale Suite fills exactly that gap.</strong> Set wholesale pricing for any type of customer and show it however fits your storefront. If you also want to vet buyers before they get in, dealer registration and approval is there too, as its own separate step, not a requirement to make pricing work.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"col-visual\" data-reveal>\n      <div class=\"feature-illustration\">\n        <div class=\"fi-window\">\n          <div class=\"fi-dots\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>\n          <div class=\"fi-stat\">\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-row\"><span class=\"fi-stat-label\">Pricing rules live</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-stat-value\">12</div>\n            <svg class=\"fi-stat-spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 24\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"><polyline points=\"0,20 15,17 30,18 45,12 60,13 75,6 100,2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-product\">\n            <div class=\"fi-product-thumb\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-product-info\">\n              <div class=\"fi-product-name\">Classic Canvas Tote</div>\n              <div class=\"fi-product-price-row\"><span class=\"fi-product-price\">One product</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"fi-product-cta\">View rules</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"fi-callout\">\n            <span class=\"fi-callout-badge\">3 PRICES</span>\n            <div class=\"fi-callout-label\"><span class=\"fi-tag-solid\">Pricing</span><span class=\"fi-dot\"></span><span class=\"fi-label-text\">Same product, priced by who\'s buying</span></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-items\">\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Retail<br>$24.00</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item active\"><span class=\"fi-check\">&#10003;</span><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale A<br>$19.20</span></div>\n              <div class=\"fi-item\"><span class=\"fi-item-label\">Wholesale B<br>$16.80</span></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"fi-divider\"></div>\n            <div class=\"fi-bottom\">\n              <div class=\"fi-bottom-left\"><span class=\"fi-tag-green\">Auto-applied</span><span class=\"fi-bottom-text\">Shown as a <strong>price badge</strong></span></div>\n              <span class=\"fi-cta-dark\">See how it works</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <svg class=\"fi-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 8c2 18 10 32 26 38\"/><path d=\"M22 40 30 47 34 36\"/></svg>\n        <p class=\"fi-caption\">one product, priced for who\'s buying</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- NUMBERS / TRUST -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Why merchants add wholesale</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">The numbers behind a wholesale channel.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lede mt-16\">What merchants typically see after launching structured wholesale pricing and dealer workflows.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"numbers-grid\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--red\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"34\" data-prefix=\"+\" data-suffix=\"%\">+0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average revenue lift after launching a wholesale channel</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--violet\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"/><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"3.2\" data-decimals=\"1\" data-suffix=\"&times;\">0&times;</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">More repeat orders from approved dealers vs. one-off buyers</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--blue\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"58\" data-prefix=\"&minus;\" data-suffix=\"%\">&minus;0%</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Less time spent managing wholesale pricing by hand</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"number-card number-card--success\">\n        \n        <div class=\"number-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <div class=\"number-value\"><span data-count=\"48\" data-suffix=\" hrs\">0 hrs</span></div>\n        <p class=\"number-label\">Average turnaround from dealer application to first order</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\" id=\"how-it-works\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>How it works</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Three independent pieces, not one rigid flow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"steps\" data-reveal-group>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <h3>You set the pricing.</h3>\n        <p>Wholesale, volume, or shipping discount rules, targeted by customer type, product, or collection. Show the result as a price badge, a tiered table, or a bulk-order view, whatever fits your storefront.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <h3>You decide who qualifies.</h3>\n        <p>Open pricing to everyone, restrict it to logged-in accounts, or run a full registration and approval queue if you want to vet dealers first. It\'s a separate setting, not a prerequisite for pricing to work.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"step\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <h3>They check out, you get paid your way.</h3>\n        <p>Straight checkout, or Pay Later on net terms through a real Shopify draft order you control end to end.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FEATURE HIGHLIGHTS GRID -->\n<section>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\" data-reveal>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>Everything wholesale needs</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">One app, the whole dealer workflow.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid-cards\" data-reveal-group>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3\"/><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Dealer Registration &amp; Approval</h3>\n        <p>An optional vetting step: custom multi-step forms and a manual approval queue for buyers you want to review before they\'re in.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"19\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"19\"/><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"17.5\" r=\"2.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Pricing Rules</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or override pricing for any customer type, targeted by product or collection, with priority and scheduling.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"10\"/><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"4\"/><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"16\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Volume Pricing</h3>\n        <p>Quantity- or amount-based tiers that stack on top of wholesale rates.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"7\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M16 10h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"5.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"18.5\" cy=\"19.5\" r=\"1.5\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Shipping Discounts</h3>\n        <p>Percent, fixed, or free shipping tiers by quantity, weight, or subtotal.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Order Limits</h3>\n        <p>Enforce min/max quantity or order value, hard block at checkout if needed.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Extra Fees &amp; Surcharges</h3>\n        <p>Add real cart line items (handling, surcharges) per item or per cart.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Pay Later / Net Terms</h3>\n        <p>Net 30/60/90 checkout via a real Shopify draft order, no automated credit decisions replacing your judgment.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.4 14.5 16 10 4 20\"/><path d=\"m3 3 18 18\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5A5 5 0 1 1 9 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Native B2B Integration</h3>\n        <p>Approved dealers become real Shopify Company/Company Location records, and checkout runs on Shopify\'s own B2B rails.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"/><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"15\"/><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"11\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Custom Invoicing</h3>\n        <p>Native Shopify invoices or fully branded PDF invoices sent via your own SMTP.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z\"/><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Tax Display &amp; Exemption</h3>\n        <p>Tax-inclusive/exclusive pricing, VAT/GST/EIN exemption submissions with live EU VAT registry verification.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18\"/><polyline points=\"17 6 23 6 23 12\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Wholesale Analytics</h3>\n        <p>Revenue, orders, and new applications at a glance.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.59 13.41 11 3.83A2 2 0 0 0 9.59 3.24H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v5.59a2 2 0 0 0 .59 1.41l9.58 9.59a2 2 0 0 0 2.82 0l4.6-4.6a2 2 0 0 0 0-2.82Z\"/><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"1\"/></svg></div>\n        <h3>Discount Labels &amp; Bulk Select</h3>\n        <p>Clear savings badges, fast multi-variant bulk ordering for dealers buying in volume.</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"center mt-32\" data-reveal>\n      <a href=\"features.html\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">See every feature in detail →</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- DIFFERENTIATOR -->\n<section class=\"section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"banner\" data-reveal-scale>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.25);\"><span class=\"dot\" style=\"background:#fff;box-shadow:none;\"></span>The key difference</span>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Works with Shopify B2B. Not around it.</h2>\n      <p>A lot of wholesale apps fight Shopify\'s own B2B system or ignore it entirely. B2B Wholesale Suite promotes your approved dealers into real Shopify Company and Company Location records, so Pay Later checkout runs through Shopify\'s actual native B2B checkout, not a bolted-on custom one. You get the app\'s dealer management and pricing rules on top of infrastructure Shopify already built and maintains.</p>\n      <div class=\"badge-row\">\n        <span class=\"pill\">Real Shopify Company records</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">Native B2B checkout</span>\n        <span class=\"pill\">No parallel platform</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"platform-logos\">\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify</span>\n        <span class=\"platform-badge\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4Z\"/><path d=\"M3 6h18\"/><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"/></svg>Shopify<span class=\"plus-tag\">Plus</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FINAL CTA -->\n<section class=\"final-cta\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\" data-reveal>\n    <h2 class=\"section-title\">Set up your wholesale channel today.</h2>\n    <p>Free to install. Set your first pricing rule in minutes.</p>\n    <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Install B2B Wholesale Suite</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','5-revision-v1','','','2026-09-14 08:23:39','2026-09-14 08:23:39','',5,'http://localhost:8888/?p=53',0,'revision','',0);
